<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">What need do children have for expensive anti=
-aging lotions and serums? None =E2=80=94 but that doesn=E2=80=99t mean the=
y don=E2=80=99t want them, anyway.&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">TikTok-influenced teenyboppers have been driv=
ing demand for skincare since 2023, when beauty retailer Sephora reported a=
 2x increase in the number of customers ages 9-12 (AKA =E2=80=9CSephora twe=
ens=E2=80=9D) over the past five years, <a href=3D"https://media.hubspot.co=
m/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWt2mB4MM7TxVK-5wJ7kJ9DyW824bMN5HZXHTMkNlmd2-ZW0W=
