<p style=3D"line-height:150%">These products are more expensive than tradit=
ional children=E2=80=99s options =E2=80=94 e.g., Johnson=E2=80=99s baby lot=
ion costs just ~$5, compared to Evereden=E2=80=99s $28 moisturizer =E2=80=
=94 but cheaper than ones offered by kid-favored adult brands, like Drunk E=
lephant=E2=80=99s $70 lotion.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%; font-weight:bold; font-size:18px">Starting th=
em young</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The children=E2=80=99s cosmetics market, a gl=
obal industry valued at ~$1.6B, is undeniable.</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;<br>A 2024 <a href=3D"https://media.hub=
spot.com/e3t/Ctc/UB+113/d2q-Vf04/VWt2mB4MM7TxVK-5wJ7kJ9DyW824bMN5HZXHTMkNll=
