<p style=3D"line-height:150%">&nbsp;</p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%"><span style=3D"font-weight: bold; font-size: =
18px;">But not everyone is happy about it</span><br><br></p>
<p style=3D"line-height:150%">The beauty-for-babies trend has divided paren=
ts, dermatologists, and the internet, with many calling it out as unnecessa=
ry and potentially harmful to kids=E2=80=99 developing skin as well as thei=
r mental health.</p>
<ul style=3D"line-height:150%">
<li aria-level=3D"1">Rini faced serious backlash over its debut product, ~$=
7 animal-themed hydrogel sheet masks for preschool-age kids, and its =E2=80=
